WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.450
The opening light chain connects on Luke.

2
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:02.450
A Rush jab carries the confirm into back heavy punch.

3
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:02.950
Serenity Stream heavy kick launches Luke.

4
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:03.750
The first Yosokyaku stomp juggles Luke.

5
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.550
The third stomp completes the repeated down-medium-kick juggle.

6
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:06.700
Chun-Li activates airborne Kikosho.

7
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:07.200
Luke falls after the Level 1 projectile.
